# Lunduke Linux Kernel: default ISO kernel for 0.9.3.
# Seeded 7.2.6-lcos20 on 2026-10-11 CT (lunduke-linux-kernel master e97fb3c5,
# PR #16, tag 7.2.6-lcos20); see config/packages.chroot/SEED-llk-7.2.6-lcos20.txt.
# Replaced lcos19 (moved to config/packages.chroot/superseded/).
# Package names are unversioned; the ABI stays 7.2.6-lunduke, so only the
# seeded debs pin the lcos20 revision.
# lcos18: DM_CRYPT=m + XTS (#123), UHID=m (#120), RMI4_F11=y (#121).
# lcos19: radeon=m, vga_switcheroo, DC_SI, HSA, FW compress (#115/#118); 948 modules.
# lcos20: EXFAT_FS=m, iocharset utf8 (#131); 949 modules. No Forced Rust.
